{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":582857,\"title\":\"For Tor's Sake\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Thor's father drinks, and Thor escapes to the woods and refuses to come home before he quits drinking. Lucky for Thor he has a lot of friends who help him.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bXWIjTAPTH7CtSGsTkJBZWvhbIU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v3LoT8JgY56SuC5S1H24WxUe0Os.jpg\",\"rating\":5.2,\"voteCount\":6,\"year\":1982,\"runtime\":82,\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"NO\",\"name\":\"Norway\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Knut Andersen\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":226223,\"name\":\"Knut Andersen\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9CO7Rhude8d8ntdlbZcDjql3N7e.jpg\"},{\"id\":2244525,\"name\":\"Jakob Ørmen\",\"character\":\"Tor\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2244526,\"name\":\"Monica Sidselrud\",\"character\":\"Laila\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1154162,\"name\":\"Ivar Nørve\",\"character\":\"Tors far\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tOZ0zEEFCfFQJF367YyVkVKEsCy.jpg\"},{\"id\":68419,\"name\":\"Helge Reiss\",\"character\":\"Lailas far\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/oPr6k727xpQVpioKaOu8Oxj46Q7.jpg\"},{\"id\":1082870,\"name\":\"Anne-Lise Tangstad\",\"character\":\"Lailas mor\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":92051,\"name\":\"Per Theodor Haugen\",\"character\":\"Kuratoren\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9THi7AjxzrRWp5OtbDJXN4sAfRH.jpg\"},{\"id\":227258,\"name\":\"Willie Hoel\",\"character\":\"Dirigenten\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4mB2pJF4AiOX20uU7jN2eUbz0Z1.jpg\"},{\"id\":213423,\"name\":\"Rolf Sand\",\"character\":\"Vaktmesteren\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/54Rnst23X7I6ffofcfieakDR2jk.jpg\"},{\"id\":1269954,\"name\":\"Inger Teien\",\"character\":\"Bente og Bjørns mor\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fsQfS6nvo3O2reO4E2vlOV2Ow8m.jpg\"},{\"id\":123963,\"name\":\"Ulf Wengård\",\"character\":\"Kompisen\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2JXwcU0bFP9zZPfipKCt8ZkEv86.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":150540,\"title\":\"Inside Out\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2H1TmgdfNtsKlU9jKdeNyYL5y8T.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jJKZaTBNenlFclQyjrnvzkRmvWE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When 11-year-old Riley moves to a new city, her Emotions team up to help her through the transition. Joy, Fear, Anger, Disgust and Sadness work together, but when Joy and Sadness get lost, they must journey through unfamiliar places to get back home.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17979,\"title\":\"A Christmas Carol\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xNwlAIdx1Ln28GRiQttUP9Gojy2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uocpNfrP0Vvnf2UxykXuIR1HNUd.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Miser Ebenezer Scrooge is awakened on Christmas Eve by spirits who reveal to him his own miserable existence, what opportunities he wasted in his youth, his current cruelties, and the dire fate that awaits him if he does not change his ways. Scrooge is faced with his own story of growing bitterness and meanness, and must decide what his own future will hold: death or redemption.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508442,\"title\":\"Soul\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hm58Jw4Lw8OIeECIq5qyPYhAeRJ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rQaHA74pevnGsxcKGaoZVGWe9TC.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Joe Gardner is a middle school teacher with a love for jazz music. After a successful audition at the Half Note Club, he suddenly gets into an accident that separates his soul from his body and is transported to the You Seminar, a center in which souls develop and gain passions before being transported to a newborn child. Joe must enlist help from the other souls-in-training, like 22, a soul who has spent eons in the You Seminar, in order to get back to Earth.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":420818,\"title\":\"The Lion King\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dzBtMocZuJbjLOXvrl4zGYigDzh.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1TUg5pO1VZ4B0Q1amk3OlXvlpXV.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Simba idolizes his father, King Mufasa, and takes to heart his own royal destiny. But not everyone in the kingdom celebrates the new cub's arrival. Scar, Mufasa's brother—and former heir to the throne—has plans of his own. The battle for Pride Rock is ravaged with betrayal, tragedy and drama, ultimately resulting in Simba's exile. With help from a curious pair of newfound friends, Simba will have to figure out how to grow up and take back what is rightfully his.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":150689,\"title\":\"Cinderella\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/j91LJmcWo16CArFOoapsz84bwxb.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q7vmCCmyiHnuKGMzHZlr0fD44b9.jpg\",\"rating\":6.8,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When her father unexpectedly passes away, young Ella finds herself at the mercy of her cruel stepmother and her daughters. Never one to give up hope, Ella's fortunes begin to change after meeting a dashing stranger in the woods.\",\"genres\":[\"Romance\",\"Fantasy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":260514,\"title\":\"Cars 3\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zg5RDxvIIAKsucjuU2EZJIHEIvz.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wvBO5vBrFQtQpJPWx83JYuysr4f.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Blindsided by a new generation of blazing-fast racers, the legendary Lightning McQueen finds himself pushed to the brink—and suddenly, the champion who once ruled the track is fighting just to stay in the race. With his career hanging in the balance, McQueen must turn to an ambitious young race technician with a plan of her own, draw strength from the legacy of the late Fabulous Hudson Hornet, and risk everything on one last shot at glory.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":9023,\"title\":\"Spirit: Stallion of the Cimarron\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bBEkKDQFianNYwGWR7gJfPVakmG.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b8hPBW0NJmiIVzvQjT3CwIpAdzl.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Against impossible odds, Spirit, a young mustang, sets out across the majestic wilderness to regain his freedom and save his homeland. Along the way, he forms a friendship with a young Lakota brave, outwits a squadron of soldiers, and ultimately, finds love.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Animation\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":508943,\"title\":\"Luca\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9x4i9uKGXt8IiiIF5Ey0DIoY738.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/620hnMVLu6RSZW6a5rwO8gqpt0t.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Luca and his best friend Alberto experience an unforgettable summer on the Italian Riviera. But all the fun is threatened by a deeply-held secret: they are sea monsters from another world just below the water’s surface.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Family\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":38575,\"title\":\"The Karate Kid\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/b1RBy3l297N0c7PHjlz35cClWju.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v8DepuF6gizphLzIyNZeQiB0hij.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2010,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"12-year-old Dre Parker could've been the most popular kid in Detroit, but his mother's latest career move has landed him in China. Dre immediately falls for his classmate Mei Ying but the cultural differences make such a friendship impossible. Even worse, Dre's feelings make him an enemy of the class bully, Cheng. With no friends in a strange land, Dre has nowhere to turn but maintenance man Mr. Han, who is a kung fu master. As Han teaches Dre that kung fu is not about punches and parries, but maturity and calm, Dre realizes that facing down the bullies will be the fight of his life.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":28178,\"title\":\"Hachi: A Dog's Tale\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lsy3aEsEfYIHdLRk4dontZ4s85h.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gOeSj4YzwxZb6FgcYPRK2hEzTdt.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Professor Wilson discovers a lost Akita puppy on his way home. Despite objections from his wife, Hachi endears himself to the family and grows to be Parker's loyal companion. As their bond grows deeper, a beautiful relationship unfolds.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1265,\"title\":\"Bridge to Terabithia\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ieIoNyJvtwQ6joyG6npTKxnCtGH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/o4mQHoP8LExn2Q9dn16OGqHvaiK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Jesse Aarons trained all summer to become the fastest runner in school. So he's very upset when newcomer Leslie Burke outruns him and everyone else. Despite this and other differences including that she's rich, he's poor, she's a city girl, and he's a country boy the two become fast friends. Together they create Terabithia, a land of monsters, trolls, ogres, and giants where they rule as king and queen.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":406997,\"title\":\"Wonder\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sONh3LYGFcVDTy8pm1tbSOB13Li.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b7xQ5fuyVO4c24igizCfPgF6n7q.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of August Pullman – a boy with facial differences – who enters fifth grade, attending a mainstream elementary school for the first time.\",\"genres\":[\"Family\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"4U9hfQujTcM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Fi2RyMQb9FE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"tQAj_ELf1I8\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}